      "source": "Delegates to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/text/NumberFormat.html#getInstance(java.util.Locale)\" title=\"class or interface in java.text\"><code>NumberFormat.getInstance(Locale)</code></a>.\nConfigures BigDecimal parsing so there is no loss in precision.\nAllows configuration over the decimal number pattern.\nThe <a href=\"AbstractNumberFormatter.html#parse(java.lang.String,java.util.Locale)\"><code>AbstractNumberFormatter.parse(String, Locale)</code></a> routine always returns a BigDecimal.",
      "translation": "委托给<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/text/NumberFormat.html#getInstance(java.util.Locale)\" title=\"class or interface in java.text\"><code>NumberFormat.getInstance(Locale)</code></a>。配置 BigDecimal 解析以确保精度不丢失。允许配置小数数字模式。<a href=\"AbstractNumberFormatter.html#parse(java.lang.String,java.util.Locale)\"><code>AbstractNumberFormatter.parse(String, Locale)</code></a> 例程始终返回一个 BigDecimal。",
      "count": 2
    },
